# doged series — patches applied on top of bitcoin-abc HEAD (see bitcoin-abc-version)
# to produce a node that syncs the Dogecoin chain.
#
# NOTE: This series is currently EMPTY. Patches must be extracted by computing
# the diff between bitcoin-abc HEAD and doged-io/doged, organized as a series.
# Extraction approach:
#   1. make setup SERIES=doged  (gets clean bitcoin-abc workspace)
#   2. git remote add doged https://github.com/doged-io/doged.git && git fetch doged
#   3. Find common ancestor: git merge-base HEAD doged/master
#   4. Cherry-pick or manually port doged-specific changes
#   5. make mkpatch SERIES=doged NAME=<patch-name>
